=== Classical binomial moment sums (elementary, standard) ===
n=5: sum C(n,i)=2^n: True   sum i*C(n,i)=n*2^(n-1): True   sum i^2*C(n,i)=n(n+1)*2^(n-2): True
n=10: sum C(n,i)=2^n: True   sum i*C(n,i)=n*2^(n-1): True   sum i^2*C(n,i)=n(n+1)*2^(n-2): True
n=13: sum C(n,i)=2^n: True   sum i*C(n,i)=n*2^(n-1): True   sum i^2*C(n,i)=n(n+1)*2^(n-2): True

=== Reduced binomial-sum identity: sum_{i=0}^{r-1}(r-i)(r-i+1)C(2r+1,i) = r*2^(2r-1) ===
holds for r=1..25: True

=== G_r(1,0) = r*phi_r/4 (the rate conjecture), via the FULL d_k^{(r)}(0) sum ===
